# Structure

## Connecting Adjectives

oishi *kute* kirei

the I turns into KUTE



Kirei de oishi 

NA turns into DE



(Subject) ha (Body Parts) ga [Adjective 1] desu

(Body Parts) ga [Adjective 1] kute / de [Adjective 2] desu

## Contrasting Statements

- Demo - but
- desuga - although, even though
- desukedo - although, even though

(Subject) ha (info) desuga (Contrast) desu

(Subject) ha (info) desukedo (Contrast) desu


(Person) ha (Adj 1) desuga/kedo (Adj 2) desu


